+/// Autoscroll rate in milli-lines per second, from two signals that answer
+/// different questions.
+///
+/// `swept_rows` — how much is already highlighted — sets the CEILING: it is a
+/// statement of intent (grabbed three lines and kept going, versus swept the
+/// whole screen first), measured as a fraction of the pane so the same gesture
